,"thumbnail":"/inspiration/brands/archi-tex/04-social-profile-small.webp","width":1600,"height":900,"contentHash":"c6b9b0df6904b38cf467fc795280243c2055992229b0a8090db3310b26088ac1","description":"Black card with the white logo, and an orange-framed dark social profile with an orange arc avatar and a building-site header photo."},{"part":"visuals","image":"/inspiration/brands/archi-tex/05-brand-poster.webp","thumbnail":"/inspiration/brands/archi-tex/05-brand-poster-small.webp","width":1600,"height":1065,"contentHash":"73879b591dfc47dc2ab6ddc6e9003753d731ebd19e967bafdf32db698380d636","description":"Roadside billboard: orange panel with stacked ARCHI TEX, a black arc symbol and a service list, beside a photo of two hard-hat workers on steel stairs."}]}'::jsonb,array['logo','typography','colors','images','composition']::text[]);
