.webp","width":1600,"height":900,"contentHash":"7ccedb5285124b9bbc885d16e42b627d14915e2043ff37dca7206cc11af242b8","fill":"#f4f6f5","description":"Dark profile card with a header photo of a mechanic beside a red-lit car, a red-ringed avatar with the AN mark and a bio about vehicle service and repair."},{"part":"visuals","image":"/inspiration/brands/autonex/05-brand-poster.webp","thumbnail":"/inspiration/brands/autonex/05-brand-poster-small.webp","width":835,"height":1080,"contentHash":"86cede407cb8765fbcba6027b42a8890447b0d3b7f27915c2ace57aafb0d3626","description":"Framed poster on a dark wall over a wet street at night: a mechanic leaning into an engine bay, with PROFESSIONAL CARE FOR EVERY VEHICLE in red and white."}]}'::jsonb,array['logo','typography','colors','images','composition']::text[]);
