xian/04-social-profile.webp","thumbnail":"/inspiration/brands/axian/04-social-profile-small.webp","width":1600,"height":842,"contentHash":"93e76b51ddcac8fd4e2db6fd1ee2c891a80973976280449edd39af3f2d2d42fd","description":"Two profile cards labeled Transport and Logistics on a dark red gradient: banners of shipping containers, with navy and orange avatars bearing the arrow."},{"part":"visuals","image":"/inspiration/brands/axian/05-brand-poster.webp","thumbnail":"/inspiration/brands/axian/05-brand-poster-small.webp","width":1600,"height":969,"contentHash":"75065c85442acbd67e271ca8ac6881c2c3b7bb1d6ad1126eafe54324ad06b974","description":"Roadside billboard at sunset above a highway: Every Shipment, Perfectly Planned. with a container port image, an orange arrow and the axian logo."}]}'::jsonb,array['logo','typography','colors','images','composition']::text[]);
