xtures and interior photos."},{"part":"socials","image":"/inspiration/brands/grupo-terra/04-social-profile.webp","thumbnail":"/inspiration/brands/grupo-terra/04-social-profile-small.webp","width":1600,"height":900,"contentHash":"84e6d5c6b30af05c3d72fa8c82be19aea7cd709653edf44eeb69b463e21dbf87","description":"A wooden-pergola terrace photo with the Terra logo and tagline, and a profile card on black with a rust wood-grain banner, T avatar and GrupoTerra Arquitetura."},{"part":"visuals","image":"/inspiration/brands/grupo-terra/05-brand-poster.webp","thumbnail":"/inspiration/brands/grupo-terra/05-brand-poster-small.webp","width":1600,"height":900,"contentHash":"6e44da11333ef937948a7c11789b69c26289b10c0e86d67fc41f4ed78aadede1","description":"Billboard set into a sand-colored concrete wall: a rust panel reading Projetamos espaços que pertencem ao lugar., a warm living-room photo and the logo."}]}'::jsonb,array['logo','typography','colors','images','composition']::text[]);
