-profile.webp","thumbnail":"/inspiration/brands/origo/04-social-profile-small.webp","width":1600,"height":928,"contentHash":"1295d2a3d5329ad81412bc7c0e7dd8b622c027fefa3345197126327445d542e6","fill":"#0213c8","description":"Two profile cards labeled Coffee on cobalt: swirling iced-coffee-and-cream banners, with cobalt and deep green badge avatars."},{"part":"visuals","image":"/inspiration/brands/origo/05-brand-poster.webp","thumbnail":"/inspiration/brands/origo/05-brand-poster-small.webp","width":1600,"height":1084,"contentHash":"340db8e9b17d098c8e40e850d7f8ec0b5c1cf480a7be48fbb3757a0b7c632037","description":"Projection screen in a dark room with a man watching: Every Journey Begins Somewhere. in brown display type beside an iced coffee and a line-drawn figure."}]}'::jsonb,array['logo','typography','colors','images','composition']::text[]);
